# Autonomous Smart City Data Intelligence System

## Overview

This project simulates and analyzes smart city data using Python.
It generates multi-source data (traffic, air quality, energy), processes it, and identifies high-risk zones using data science techniques.

The system adapts based on user input and provides insights about city conditions.

---

## Features

* Random simulation of city zones
* Data stored using list of dictionaries
* Conversion to Pandas DataFrame
* NumPy-based statistical analysis
* Custom risk score calculation
* Priority-based analysis (Air Quality / Traffic / Energy)
* Custom sorting implementation (no built-in sorting)
* Pattern detection:

  * High-risk zones
  * Stability analysis
  * Risk clusters
* Final decision system:

  * City Stable
  * Moderate Risk
  * High Alert
  * Critical Emergency

---

## Technologies Used

* Python
* Pandas
